## Task Management System
- After completing each task, update memory with "TASK COMPLETED: [task description]" and results
- When identifying new issues, create new tasks with "NEW TASK: [task description]"
- Break down complex tasks into subtasks with "SUBTASK: [subtask description]"
- Upon task completion, move to memory log with "LOGGED: [completed task]"
- Review memory log after each task or every 2 subtasks, noting "MEMORY LOG REVIEWED"
- When uncertain, reference memory log with "REFERENCING MEMORY LOG: [specific question]"
- Maintain running list of active tasks and completed tasks
- After significant milestones, summarize with "MILESTONE REACHED: [description]"

